{
  "name": "macpro-data-migrations",
  "description": "An internal data migration project, aim to host ETL code associated with migrating MACPRO systems into MAC Suite OneMAC SMART application.",
  "longDescription": "macpro-data-migrations hosts deterministic Python ETL and migration support assets for moving legacy MACPRO data into the MAC Suite OneMAC SMART Salesforce application. The active smart-data-migration project transforms SEA Tool CSV exports and OneMAC JSON exports into SMART load files, performs reference lookups, validates mapping contracts, and produces run-scoped audit artifacts for QA, UAT, and operational migration work.",
